# packages/nvidia.list — NOT baked into the image. chroot.sh downloads
# these (+ full dependency closure) into a tiny pacman repo at
# /usr/share/illogical-impulse/nvidia inside the squashfs; ii-post-install
# detects NVIDIA hardware on the installed machine and installs the right
# variant from it, fully offline, no questions asked:
#
#   GPU in supported-gpus.json with "kernelopen" (Turing+) → nvidia-open-dkms
#   older NVIDIA (Maxwell/Pascal)                          → nvidia-580xx-dkms (AUR legacy)
#   no NVIDIA                                              → nothing; stash removed
nvidia-open-dkms
nvidia-utils
nvidia-580xx-dkms
nvidia-580xx-utils
linux-headers
linux-lts-headers
